{"slug":"longest-substring-k-distinct","title":"At Most k Different Letters","topic":"arrays-strings","difficulty":"medium","order":142,"tags":["strings","sliding-window","counting"],"timeLimitMs":2000,"concept":{"title":"A window with a counter for each letter","body":["To limit the number of **different** letters in a window, keep a table `count` with the number of times each letter occurs in the window, and a variable `distinct` with the number of letters whose count is above zero.",{"code":"c = ord(ch) - 97\nif count[c] == 0: distinct += 1\ncount[c] += 1\nwhile distinct > k:\n    d = ord(s[l]) - 97\n    count[d] -= 1\n    if count[d] == 0: distinct -= 1\n    l += 1"},"Adding a letter can only increase `distinct`; removing letters from the left shrinks it again. After the loop the window is valid and its length is a candidate for the answer."]},"statement":["Given a word and a number `k`, find the length of the longest block of consecutive letters that contains at most `k` different letters."],"inputFormat":["The first line has `k`.","The second line has the word."],"outputFormat":["Print one integer."],"constraints":["1 <= k <= 26","1 <= length of the word <= 20000","The word contains lowercase letters."],"examples":[{"input":"2\neceba\n","output":"3\n","note":"The block ece has two different letters and length 3."}],"hints":["Count the letters inside the window and keep the number of different letters.","When there are more than k different letters, remove letters from the left.","Update the best length after the window is valid again."],"starter":{"python":"k = int(input())\ns = input().strip()\n\n# Your code here\n","cpp":"#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\n#include <algorithm>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    long long k;\n    cin >> k;\n    string s;\n    cin >> s;\n\n    // Your code here\n\n    return 0;\n}\n","java":"import java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        long k = sc.nextLong();\n        String s = sc.next();\n\n        // Your code here\n    }\n}\n"},"solution":{"explanation":["The window keeps at most `k` different letters. The counters tell when a letter disappears from the window completely."],"complexity":"Time O(n), space O(1).","code":{"python":"k = int(input())\ns = input().strip()\n\ncount = [0] * 26\ndistinct = 0\nl = 0\nbest = 0\nfor rr, ch in enumerate(s):\n    c = ord(ch) - ord(\"a\")\n    if count[c] == 0:\n        distinct += 1\n    count[c] += 1\n    while distinct > k:\n        d = ord(s[l]) - ord(\"a\")\n        count[d] -= 1\n        if count[d] == 0:\n            distinct -= 1\n        l += 1\n    best = max(best, rr - l + 1)\nprint(best)\n","cpp":"#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\n#include <algorithm>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    long long k;\n    cin >> k;\n    string s;\n    cin >> s;\n\n    int count[26] = {0};\n    int distinct = 0, l = 0, best = 0;\n    for (int rr = 0; rr < (int) s.size(); rr++) {\n        int c = s[rr] - 'a';\n        if (count[c] == 0) distinct++;\n        count[c]++;\n        while (distinct > k) {\n            int d = s[l] - 'a';\n            count[d]--;\n            if (count[d] == 0) distinct--;\n            l++;\n        }\n        best = max(best, rr - l + 1);\n    }\n    cout << best << \"\\n\";\n\n    return 0;\n}\n","java":"import java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        long k = sc.nextLong();\n        String s = sc.next();\n\n        int[] count = new int[26];\n        int distinct = 0, l = 0, best = 0;\n        for (int rr = 0; rr < s.length(); rr++) {\n            int c = s.charAt(rr) - 'a';\n            if (count[c] == 0) distinct++;\n            count[c]++;\n            while (distinct > k) {\n                int d = s.charAt(l) - 'a';\n                count[d]--;\n                if (count[d] == 0) distinct--;\n                l++;\n            }\n            best = Math.max(best, rr - l + 1);\n        }\n        System.out.println(best);\n    }\n}\n"}},"tests":[{"input":"2\neceba\n","output":"3\n"},{"input":"1\na\n","output":"1\n"},{"input":"1\naaabbb\n","output":"3\n"},{"input":"3\nabcabc\n","output":"6\n"},{"input":"26\nabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz\n","output":"26\n"},{"input":"3\nddefcfcecaeffeadccddddfbaaabdccceefbdfbfdacccdfdeebedbfcbdfa\n","output":"8\n"},{"input":"2\\n","output":"11\n"},{"input":"4\\n","output":"17\n"},{"input":"5\\n","output":"11\n"}]}